{"id":"230b6c3bb3938a47","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md","title":"Thurston Geometry","display":"df-thurston-geometry — Thurston Geometry","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-thurston-geometry","aliases":["58-df-thurston-geometry","Thurston Geometry"],"display":"df-thurston-geometry — Thurston Geometry","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-thurston-geometry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-thurston-geometry</span><span>Thurston Geometry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-thurston-geometry — Thurston Geometry"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol}\\in V\">\\(E,S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EightThurstonGeometries}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{EightThurstonGeometries}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的最小等势序数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality.md\">58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}thurston\\text{-}geometry}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EightThurstonGeometries}_S(E,S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nE=\\{S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol}\\}\n\\land |E|=8.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}thurston\\text{-}geometry}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{EightThurstonGeometries}_S(E,S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nE=\\{S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol}\\}\n\\land |E|=8.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thurston geometrization: 3-manifolds decompose into pieces admitting one of 8 geometries</li>\n<li>Geometric types: the three constant-curvature geometries (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3\">\\(S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3\\)</span>), two product geometries, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nil}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nil}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde{SL_2(\\mathbb R)}\">\\(\\widetilde{SL_2(\\mathbb R)}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sol}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sol}\\)</span>; “flat” is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^3\">\\(\\mathbb R^3\\)</span> case, not a ninth geometry.</li>\n<li>Perelman's theorem: proof of Poincaré and geometrization conjecture</li>\n<li>Classification: Seifert fibered, Haken, hyperbolic, torus bundles underpins the program</li>\n<li>Applications: knot theory, 3-manifold invariants, quantum gravity</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thurston, Three-Dimensional Geometry and Topology</li>\n<li>Scott, The Geometries of 3-Manifolds</li>\n<li>Bonahon, Geometric Structures on 3-Manifolds</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的最小等势序数，使用 [[58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EightThurstonGeometries}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}thurston\\text{-}geometry}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{EightThurstonGeometries}_S(E,S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nE=\\{S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3,S^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\mathbb H^2\\times\\mathbb R,\\widetilde{\\mathrm{SL}}_2(\\mathbb R),\\mathrm{Nil},\\mathrm{Sol}\\}\n\\land |E|=8.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S^3,\\mathbb R^3,\\mathbb H^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nil}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widetilde{SL_2(\\mathbb R)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sol}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^3","display":false}],"bytes":1815,"backlinks":[{"id":"9cca4c00e961ff80","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EightGeometries}_S$（八种 Thurston 模型几何, see [[../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md]]）"},{"id":"f8cdda6985c34f12","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-thurston-geometry]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1294","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-thurston-geometry.md|58-df-thurston-geometry]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}